# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is intended to become PUBLIC.
#
# Everything below is either machine-specific, generated, or material that is
# not ours to publish. The rules in the "must never be committed" section are
# not cleanliness preferences — they exist because this repo is developed inside
# a larger private workspace that contains the decompiled game source and
# agent-facing notes. Do not relax them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# === MUST NEVER BE COMMITTED ===============================================

# Decompiled Necesse source. The game's source was never publicly released;
# it is proprietary and redistributing it is not ours to do.
reference/
necesse-src/
**/necesse-src/
*.class

# Wiki dumps and derived data. Scraped third-party content — not ours.
wiki-pages/
wiki-raw/
wiki-json/
wiki-pages.jsonl
grep/

# Agent configuration and agent-facing context. Development tooling, not
# part of the mod, and not useful or appropriate for the public repo.
#
# NOTE: this repo has its own docs/ directory, and its contents ARE committed.
# The specific filenames below are the private workspace's notes, shadowed here
# on purpose so that copying one in cannot leak it. Agent guidance meant for
# this repo belongs in AGENTS.md, which is public by design.
.kiro/
docs/WORKFLOW.md
docs/MODDING_API.md
docs/GAME_SYSTEMS.md
docs/STORAGE_AND_INVENTORY.md
docs/MOD_BRIEF.md
docs/ASSETS.md

# Secrets. Nothing here should ever exist in this repo, but be explicit.
.secrets/
*.cookies
*.env
!*.env.example

# Raw game assets extracted from the installation (res.data and friends).
# Derived sprites we ship live in src/main/resources/ and are committed;
# bulk extractions of the game's own art are not.
game-assets/
res.data
extracted-res/

# === MACHINE-SPECIFIC ======================================================

# Contains absolute paths to this machine's Necesse install and JDK.
# Copy gradle.properties.example and edit it locally.
gradle.properties

# === GENERATED / BUILD =====================================================
build/
.gradle/
out/
*.jar
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
steam_appid.txt
latest-crash.log
latest-log.txt

# === EDITORS / OS ==========================================================
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*~

# Eclipse/Buildship files, written by the language server. Machine-specific -- they carry
# absolute paths and a local java.home -- so they are noise in a shared repo.
.project
.classpath
.settings/
